  {
    "id": 2002012110170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『付き合ってくれ』って話、\r\nどう説明するつもりだったんですか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201211/2002012110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー……\r\n何か、こっちの有名なものでも食べに行った……かな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002012110180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なるほど",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201211/2002012110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002012110190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それはそれで、少し気になりますね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201211/2002012110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お。食いつきがいいな\r\n海が見られた記念に、夕飯食べて帰るか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002012110200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっ！\r\nいえ、両方は贅沢ですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201211/2002012110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002012110210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "海だけで十分です",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201211/2002012110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？\r\n両方でもいいと思うけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002012110220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それはまたの機会で\r\nありがとうございます",
